msgid "These changes affect the cached results of this Filter.  Saving it starts a materialization in the background to rebuild them.  Press 'Continue' to save the Filter, or 'Cancel' to keep editing it."
msgstr "እነዚህ ለውጦች የዚህን ማጣሪያ በመሸጎጫ የተቀመጡ ውጤቶች ይነካሉ። ማስቀመጡ እነሱን እንደገና ለመገንባት ከበስተጀርባ ቁሳቁሳዊ ሂደትን ይጀምራል። ማጣሪያውን ለማስቀመጥ 'ቀጥል'ን ይጫኑ፣ ወይም አርትዖቱን ለመቀጠል 'ይቅር'ን ይጫኑ።"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "The changes to this Filter affect its cached results, so a materialization of it has been started in the background.  Its progress is shown on the Filters page and its results are reported in the Cacti log."
