#: setup.php
msgid "The Aria Engine is perfect for all but the Live raw table.  The Live raw table will always be InnoDB.  Take your pick."
msgstr "የAria ሞተር ከLive ጥሬ ሠንጠረዥ በስተቀር ለሁሉም ተስማሚ ነው። የLive ጥሬ ሠንጠረዥ ሁልጊዜ InnoDB ይሆናል። ምርጫዎን ይምረጡ።"

#: setup.php
msgid "Parallel Queries"
msgstr "ትይዩ ጥያቄዎች"

#: setup.php
msgid "Parallel Query Backend"
msgstr "የትይዩ ጥያቄ ጀርባ (Backend)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Choose how parallel FlowView queries are executed.  The Legacy PHP Runner forks the flowview_runner.php process per query and shard.  The FlowView Query Service dispatches the same map-reduce work to a long-running Go service over localhost, avoiding per-query process startup and database polling latency.  Requires the flowview-query service (see plugins/flowview/service/flowview-query) to be installed and running."
msgstr "ትይዩ የFlowView መጠይቆች እንዴት እንደሚፈጸሙ ይምረጡ። የቆየው PHP Runner ለእያንዳንዱ መጠይቅ እና ሻርድ የflowview_runner.php ሂደትን ይከፍላል። የFlowView Query Service ያንኑ የmap-reduce ስራ በlocalhost ላይ ለረጅም ጊዜ ወደሚሰራ የGo አገልግሎት ይልካል፣ ይህም የእያንዳንዱን መጠይቅ ሂደት መጀመሪያ እና የውሂብ ጎታ መጠየቂያ መዘግየትን ያስቀራል። የflowview-query አገልግሎት (plugins/flowview/service/flowview-query ይመልከቱ) ተጭኖ እየሰራ መሆን አለበት።"

#: setup.php
msgid "Legacy PHP Runner"
msgstr "ቀደምት PHP አስኬጅ"

#: setup.php
msgid "FlowView Query Service"
msgstr "የFlowView መጠይቅ አገልግሎት"

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service URL"
msgstr "የመጠይቅ አገልግሎት URL"

#: setup.php
msgid "Base URL of the FlowView Query Service, for example http://127.0.0.1:8699.  Leave blank to auto-discover the ephemeral port from the service's port file."
msgstr "የFlowView መጠይቅ አገልግሎት መሰረታዊ URL፣ ለምሳሌ http://127.0.0.1:8699። ጊዜያዊ ወደቡን ከአገልግሎቱ የወደብ ፋይል በራስ-ሰር ለማግኘት ባዶ ይተዉት።"

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service Port File"
msgstr "የመጠይቅ አገልግሎት ወደብ ፋይል"

#: setup.php
msgid "Path to the port file the FlowView Query Service writes its bound address to.  Used to discover the service endpoint when the Query Service URL above is blank."
msgstr "የFlowView ጥያቄ አገልግሎት የታሰረበትን አድራሻ የሚጽፍበት የወደብ ፋይል መንገድ። ከላይ ያለው የጥያቄ አገልግሎት URL ባዶ ሲሆን የአገልግሎት መጨረሻ ነጥቡን ለማግኘት ያገለግላል።"

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service Token"
msgstr "የመጠይቅ አገልግሎት ቶከን"

#: setup.php
msgid "Optional shared secret.  When set, Cacti sends it to the FlowView Query Service as an \"Authorization: Bearer\" header and the service rejects any state-changing request that does not present the same token.  Set the matching value in the service's config file (auth_token) or the FLOWVIEW_QUERY_TOKEN environment variable.  Recommended whenever the service is reachable by anything other than trusted local processes."
msgstr "አማራጭ የተጋራ ምስጢር። ሲዋቀር፣ Cacti ወደ FlowView Query Service እንደ \"Authorization: Bearer\" ራስጌ ይልከዋል እና አገልግሎቱ ተመሳሳዩን ቶከን የማያቀርብ ማንኛውንም ሁኔታ የሚቀይር ጥያቄ ውድቅ ያደርጋል። ተዛማጁን እሴት በአገልግሎቱ የውቅር ፋይል (auth_token) ወይም በFLOWVIEW_QUERY_TOKEN የአካባቢ ተለዋዋጭ ውስጥ ያዋቅሩ። አገልግሎቱ ከታመኑ አካባቢያዊ ሂደቶች ውጭ በማንኛውም ነገር ተደራሽ በሆነበት ጊዜ ሁሉ ይመከራል።"

#: setup.php
msgid "Max Concurrent Threads"
msgstr "ከፍተኛ ተጓዳኝ ክሮች"

#: setup.php
msgid "The maximum number of threads that will be dispatched to run the FlowView queries.  Note that you can have at most 1 thread per database partition, and you should be careful not to overload your database server with having too many concurrent threads running."
msgstr "የ FlowView መጠይቆችን ለማስኬድ የሚላኩ ከፍተኛው የክሮች ብዛት። በአንድ የውሂብ ጎታ ክፍልፋይ ቢበዛ 1 ክር ብቻ ሊኖርዎት እንደሚችል ልብ ይበሉ፤ እንዲሁም በተመሳሳይ ጊዜ ብዙ ክሮች በማስኬድ የውሂብ ጎታ አገልጋይዎን እንዳይጫኑ መጠንቀቅ አለብዎት።"

#: setup.php
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "ተሰናክሏል"

#: setup.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Threads"
msgstr "%d ክሮች"

#: setup.php
msgid "Maximum Run Time"
msgstr "ከፍተኛ የሩጫ ጊዜ"

#: setup.php
msgid "If the Parallel Query does not finish in this time, exit."
msgstr "ትይዩ መጠይቁ በዚህ ጊዜ ውስጥ ካልተጠናቀቀ፣ ውጣ።"

#: setup.php
msgid "Cached Data Time to Live"
msgstr "የተሸጎጠ ውሂብ የቆይታ ጊዜ (TTL)"

#: setup.php
msgid "How long should FlowView hold onto Cached Query results before purging them?"
msgstr "FlowView የተሸጎጡ የመጠይቅ ውጤቶችን ከማጽዳቱ በፊት ለምን ያህል ጊዜ መያዝ አለበት?"

#: setup.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Hours"
msgstr "%d ሰዓታት"

#: setup.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Day"
msgstr "%d ቀን"

#: setup.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Days"
msgstr "%d ቀናት"

#: setup.php
msgid "MaxScale Sharding"
msgstr "MaxScale ሻርዲንግ"

#: setup.php
msgid "This is only required if your Cacti System's Flowview Database connection is not already using a MaxScale enabled Read-Write Split port."
msgstr "ይህ የሚያስፈልገው የCacti ስርዓትዎ የFlowview የውሂብ ጎታ ግንኙነት አስቀድሞ MaxScale የነቃ የማንበብ-መጻፍ መከፋፈያ ወደብ እየተጠቀመ ካልሆነ ብቻ ነው።"

#: setup.php
msgid "Leverage MaxScale to Distribute Query Shards"
msgstr "የመጠይቅ ክፍልፋዮችን ለማሰራጨት MaxScale ይጠቀሙ"

#: setup.php
msgid "If you have multiple service acting as slaves for MaxScale, you can increase the speed of querying by distributing the parallel queries to multiple MariaDB backend servers."
msgstr "ለMaxScale እንደ ተከታይ (slave) ሆነው የሚያገለግሉ ብዙ አገልግሎቶች ካሉዎት፣ ትይዩ መጠይቆችን ወደ ብዙ የMariaDB የኋላ አገልጋዮች በማሰራጨት የመጠይቅ ፍጥነትን መጨመር ይችላሉ።"

#: setup.php
msgid "MaxScale Read-Write Split Port"
msgstr "የMaxScale ንባብ-ጽሑፍ መከፋፈያ ወደብ"

#: setup.php
msgid "This should be the port of the Read-Write-Split-Service (readwrite) service and router."
msgstr "ይህ የRead-Write-Split-Service (readwrite) አገልግሎት እና ራውተር ወደብ መሆን አለበት።"

